      "title": "🔍 Guide: 4K 360° Panorama Upscaler (RealESRGAN 2x + Seam Fix)",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 🌐 4K 360° Panorama Super-Resolution\n\nHigh-speed 2× neural upscaling for 360° equirectangular panoramas!\n\n### ⚙️ Pipeline Specifications\n• **Upscale Model**: `RealESRGAN_x2plus.pth` (Official 2× Super-Resolution model)\n• **Native Scaling ($2K \\to 4K$)**: Scales native $2048 \\times 1024$ input directly to pristine **$4096 \\times 2048$ (4K Ultra VR 2:1)** in ~2–3 seconds without downsampling blur.\n• **5% Toroidal Boundary Seam Wrap (`seamless_boundary: true`)**: Clones 5% opposite margins across edges during the neural model pass, ensuring the $0^\\circ / 360^\\circ$ wrap line is 100% seamless without vertical stitch lines.\n• **Processing Mode**: Full Frame (Best Quality) processes the entire sphere at once for unbroken global coherence.\n• **Interactive 360° VR Viewer**: Drag with the mouse to inspect any angle of the upscaled 4K world directly in ComfyUI.\n• **Metadata Export**: Injects standard Google Photo Sphere XMP metadata so output PNG/JPG automatically triggers 360° VR playback on VR headsets, Google, and Facebook.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Quick Start Instructions\n1. Drop any generated 2K panorama (from our generation workflow) into **[Input 2K Panorama Image]**.\n2. Ensure `RealESRGAN_x2plus.pth` is selected in **[Load Upscale Model]**.\n3. Click **Queue Prompt**: your 4K equirectangular panorama will be ready and displayed in the 360 viewer in seconds!"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# 🌐 4K 360° Panorama Super-Resolution\n\nHigh-speed 2× neural upscaling for 360° equirectangular panoramas!\n\n• **Model**: `RealESRGAN_x2plus.pth`\n• **Resolution**: 2048x1024 (2K) -> 4096x2048 (4K)\n• **Seamless Seam Fix**: 5% toroidal boundary wrapping eliminates stitch lines."
      },
      "color": "#1b4332",
      "bgcolor": "#2d6a4f"
    },
